[
  {
    "content_id": "10029001001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 1:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29001001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;以下是耶和华对毗土珥的儿子约珥所说的话。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029001002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 1:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29001002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;长老们啊，要听此言！ 此地所有的居民啊，要留心听！ 在你们或你们祖先的时代可曾发生过这样的事？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029001003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 1:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29001003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;要把这事告诉你们的子子孙孙， 传到世世代代！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029001004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 1:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29001004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;蝗虫吃剩的，蝻子来吃； 蝻子吃剩的，蚱蜢来吃； 蚱蜢吃剩的，蚂蚱来吃。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029001005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 1:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29001005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;醉酒之徒啊，醒过来哭泣吧！ 贪杯的人啊，哀号吧！ 你们再无美酒可饮了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029001006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 1:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29001006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;有一群强大的队伍侵犯我的国土， 它们不计其数， 有雄狮的獠牙和母狮的利齿。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029001007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 1:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29001007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;它们毁坏我的葡萄树和无花果树， 剥光树皮，然后丢弃， 只留下光秃的树枝。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029001008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 1:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29001008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;我的子民啊，你们要哀哭， 像身披麻衣的少女哭她的未婚夫。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029001009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 1:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29001009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;耶和华殿中的素祭和奠祭都停止了， 事奉耶和华的祭司都哀伤。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029001010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 1:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29001010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;田园荒废，遍地凄凉， 五谷尽毁， 再也没有新酒和油了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029001011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 1:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29001011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;农夫啊，你们要忧伤！ 照料葡萄园的人啊， 你们要哀号！ 因为田间的大麦和小麦全毁了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029001012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 1:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29001012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;葡萄树枯死， 无花果树凋残， 石榴树、棕树、苹果树等田野的一切树木枯干。 人间的欢乐消逝了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029001013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 1:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29001013",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;祭司啊，披上麻衣痛哭吧； 在祭坛前事奉的人啊，要哀号； 我上帝的仆人啊，要披上麻衣过夜； 因为再无素祭和奠祭献到你们上帝的殿中了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029001014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 1:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29001014",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;你们要宣布禁食的圣日， 举行庄严的聚会， 召集长老和当地所有居民， 到你们的上帝耶和华的殿中， 向耶和华呼求。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029001015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 1:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29001015",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;那日可怕呀！耶和华的日子近了， 那是全能者施行毁灭的日子。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029001016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 1:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29001016",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;我们亲眼看着粮食断绝， 我们上帝殿中的欢乐消失。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029001017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 1:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29001017",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;种子在土里腐烂， 五谷枯死，仓库荒废， 谷仓被拆毁。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029001018",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 1:18",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29001018",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>18</sup>&nbsp;牲畜哀鸣， 牛群因无草场而彷徨， 羊群也受苦。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029001019",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 1:19",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29001019",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>19</sup>&nbsp;耶和华啊，我向你呼求， 因为火焰吞灭了旷野的草场， 烈火烧光了田野的树木。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029001020",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 1:20",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29001020",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>20</sup>&nbsp;田野的走兽向你呼求， 因为溪水已经枯干， 火也烧尽了旷野的草场。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029002001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 2:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29002001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;你们要在锡安吹响号角， 在我的圣山上发出警讯， 此地的居民都要颤抖， 因为耶和华的日子将要来临， 已经近了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029002002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 2:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29002002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;那是昏暗阴沉的日子， 是乌云密布的日子。 来了一支空前绝后、强盛无比的大军， 它们像曙光一样布满山岭。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029002003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 2:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29002003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;它们前面有燎原之火， 后面有熊熊烈焰。 它们到来之前， 大地就像伊甸园； 它们过去之后， 大地变成荒凉的旷野。 地上的一切都逃不过这一场浩劫。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029002004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 2:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29002004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;它们的形状像马， 疾驰如战马，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029002005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 2:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29002005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;在山岭上跳跃奔腾， 如隆隆战车， 好像烈火吞噬干草的声音， 又如大军列阵备战。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029002006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 2:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29002006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;百姓一看到它们，就惊慌失措， 面如死灰。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029002007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 2:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29002007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;它们快速奔跑像勇士， 攀登城墙如战士， 有条不紊地前进。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029002008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 2:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29002008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;队伍整齐，各行其道， 长驱直入，势不可挡。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029002009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 2:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29002009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;它们冲向城邑，蹿上城墙， 爬进房屋， 如盗贼般破窗而入。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029002010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 2:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29002010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;所到之处， 天摇地动， 日月昏暗， 星辰无光。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029002011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 2:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29002011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;耶和华向祂的军队发号施令， 祂的队伍不计其数， 执行祂命令的是劲旅。 耶和华的日子伟大而可畏， 谁能承受得住呢？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029002012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 2:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29002012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;耶和华说： “现在你们要禁食、哭泣、哀号， 全心回转归向我。”</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029002013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 2:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29002013",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;你们要撕心般地痛悔， 而不是撕裂衣服。 归向你们的上帝耶和华吧， 因为祂有恩典、好怜悯， 不轻易发怒， 充满慈爱， 不忍心降灾祸。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029002014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 2:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29002014",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;或许祂转念心生怜悯， 给你们留下祝福， 使你们可以再次向你们的上帝耶和华献上素祭和奠祭。 有谁知道呢？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029002015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 2:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29002015",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;要在锡安山吹响号角， 宣布禁食的圣日， 举行庄严的聚会。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029002016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 2:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29002016",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;要招聚老人， 聚集孩童和吃奶的婴儿； 要吩咐新郎出洞房、 新娘出内室； 要召集全体人民， 让会众洁净自己。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029002017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 2:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29002017",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;让事奉耶和华的祭司站在圣殿门廊和祭坛中间， 哭泣恳求说： “耶和华啊， 求你顾惜你的子民， 不要让外族人侮辱、 讥笑你的产业说， ‘他们的上帝在哪里呢？’”</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029002018",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 2:18",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29002018",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>18</sup>&nbsp;耶和华笃爱祂的土地， 祂怜悯自己的子民。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029002019",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 2:19",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29002019",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>19</sup>&nbsp;祂回应他们说： “我必赐五谷、新酒和橄榄油给你们， 使你们饱足， 不再让你们受列国的羞辱。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029002020",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 2:20",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29002020",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>20</sup>&nbsp;我要使北方的军队远离你们， 把他们驱逐到一个干旱荒芜的地方， 把他们的领头部队赶进死海， 再把他们的殿后部队赶进地中海， 那时他们必臭气冲天、 恶味上腾， 因为耶和华为你们行了大事。”</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029002021",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 2:21",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29002021",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>21</sup>&nbsp;土地啊，不要害怕， 倒要欢喜快乐； 因为耶和华行了大事。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029002022",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 2:22",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29002022",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>22</sup>&nbsp;田野的走兽啊，不要害怕， 因为青草铺遍了旷野， 树木也结满了果子， 无花果树和葡萄树都结实累累。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029002023",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 2:23",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29002023",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>23</sup>&nbsp;锡安的人民啊， 你们要快乐， 因你们的上帝耶和华而喜乐。 因为祂按时降下甘霖， 像从前一样赐给你们秋雨和 春雨。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029002024",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 2:24",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29002024",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>24</sup>&nbsp;麦场必堆满五谷， 酒槽里的酒和油槽里的油必满溢。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029002025",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 2:25",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29002025",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>25</sup>&nbsp;“我派蝻虫、蚱蜢、蚂蚱 和蝗虫大军在那些年所吃掉的， 我要补偿你们。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029002026",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 2:26",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29002026",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>26</sup>&nbsp;你们必吃得饱足， 并赞美你们的上帝耶和华的名， 因祂为你们行了奇事。 我的子民永远不会再蒙羞。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029002027",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 2:27",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29002027",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>27</sup>&nbsp;这样，你们就知道我在以色列， 知道我是你们的上帝耶和华， 除我以外别无他神。 我的子民永远不会再蒙羞。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029002028",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 2:28",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29002028",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>28</sup>&nbsp;“以后，我要将我的灵浇灌所有的人。 你们的儿女要说预言， 老人要做异梦， 青年要见异象。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029002029",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 2:29",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29002029",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>29</sup>&nbsp;在那些日子， 我要将我的灵浇灌我的奴仆和婢女。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029002030",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 2:30",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29002030",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>30</sup>&nbsp;“我要在天上地下行奇事，你们将看见血、火和烟柱。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029002031",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 2:31",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29002031",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>31</sup>&nbsp;太阳要变得昏暗，月亮要变得血红。在耶和华伟大而可畏的日子来临以前，这些事都会发生。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029002032",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 2:32",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29002032",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>32</sup>&nbsp;那时候，凡求告耶和华之名的人都必得救，因为在锡安山，在耶路撒冷城，必有逃脱灾难的人，耶和华所呼召的人必幸存下来，正如耶和华所言。”</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029003001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 3:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29003001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;“到那日，我要使犹大和耶路撒冷被掳的人返乡。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029003002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 3:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29003002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;那时，我要聚集万国，带他们下到约沙法谷，在那里审判他们，因为他们把我的子民，就是我的产业以色列，分散到各国，并瓜分我的土地。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029003003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 3:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29003003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;他们抽签分了我的子民，将男童换妓女，卖女童买酒喝。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029003004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 3:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29003004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;“泰尔、西顿和非利士境内所有的人啊，你们为什么这样对我？你们要报复我吗？如果你们是报复我，我必速速使你们遭报应。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029003005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 3:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29003005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;你们夺去我的金银，抢走我的珍宝，拿去放在你们的庙中，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029003006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 3:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29003006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;并把犹大和耶路撒冷的居民卖给希腊人，使他们远离家乡。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029003007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 3:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29003007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;然而，他们被卖到哪里，我要促使他们从哪里离开，并要使你们得到报应，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029003008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 3:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29003008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;我必把你们的儿女卖给犹大人，犹大人必把他们卖给远方的示巴人。这是耶和华说的。”</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029003009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 3:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29003009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;你们去向列国宣告： “要召集勇士，征调军队， 前去打仗！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029003010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 3:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29003010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;要将犁头打成刀剑， 把镰刀铸成矛头， 弱者要说自己是勇士！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029003011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 3:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29003011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;四围的列国啊， 你们快快聚集到那里吧！” 耶和华啊， 求你差遣大能的勇士降临。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029003012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 3:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29003012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;“列国都要起来， 上到约沙法谷， 因为我要坐在那里审判周边列国。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029003013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 3:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29003013",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;开镰吧，因为庄稼熟了； 踩踏吧，因为榨酒池的葡萄满了。 酒池满溢，因为他们恶贯满盈。”</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029003014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 3:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29003014",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;千千万万的人聚集在审判谷， 因为耶和华的日子要临到那里。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029003015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 3:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29003015",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;日月昏暗， 星辰无光。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029003016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 3:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29003016",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;耶和华从锡安发出怒吼， 从耶路撒冷发出雷声， 天地为之震动。 但耶和华却是祂子民的避难所， 是以色列人的堡垒。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029003017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 3:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29003017",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;“这样，你们就知道我是你们的上帝耶和华， 我住在我的圣山锡安。 耶路撒冷必为圣城， 外族人必不再侵犯它。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029003018",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 3:18",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29003018",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>18</sup>&nbsp;“到那日，群山要滴下甜酒， 丘陵要流出乳汁。 犹大的溪涧碧水常流， 必有清泉从耶和华的殿中流出， 浇灌什亭谷。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029003019",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 3:19",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29003019",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>19</sup>&nbsp;埃及必一片荒凉， 以东必成为荒凉的旷野， 因为他们曾残暴地对待犹大人， 在犹大滥杀无辜。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029003020",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 3:20",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29003020",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>20</sup>&nbsp;但犹大必常有人住， 耶路撒冷必存到万代。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10029003021",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约珥书 3:21",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "29003021",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>21</sup>&nbsp;我必追讨尚未追讨的血债， 因为耶和华住在锡安。”</p>"
  }
]